= partial 'hero'

section.section.prologue
  .container
    p.eyebrow Why Padrino
    h2.prologue__lead
      | Many people love the simplicity and expressiveness of Sinatra,
      span.prologue__lead-muted<
        | but quickly find themselves missing much of what frameworks such as
          Rails provide once their applications grow.
    p.section__lead.prologue__text
      | Sinatra is a thin layer on top of Rack that adds complexity only when
        an application needs it. We expand on it with the helpers, generators
        and other standard libraries a framework needs for apps of any size,
        from a lightweight JSON service to a large full-stack site.
    blockquote.prologue__quote
      p
        | Our goal with Padrino is to stay true to the core principles of
          Sinatra, including a focus on simplicity and modularity.
    p.prologue__motto
      - data.home.principles.each do |principle|
        span= principle
        '

section.section.section--soft
  .container
    .features
      - data.home.features.each do |feature|
        article.feature
          .feature__text
            p.eyebrow= feature.eyebrow
            h3.feature__title= feature.title
            p= feature.text
            = link_to feature.link, class: 'arrow-link' do
              = feature.link_text
              = icon(:arrow_right)
          - if feature.aside == 'generator'
            = partial '/_partials/generator'
          - else
            = partial '/_partials/code_window', locals: { window: feature }

section.section.section--soft
  .container
    .section__header
      p.eyebrow Comprehensive
      h2.section__title Everything else, out of the box
      p.section__lead
        | Building on our experience with web applications, we designed
          Padrino to include what a top-notch app needs, in a clean, concise
          and simple environment.
    ul.toolkit
      - data.home.toolkit.each do |item|
        li
          = link_to item.link, class: 'toolkit__item' do
            span.toolkit__icon= icon(item.icon.to_sym)
            span
              span.toolkit__title= item.title
              span.toolkit__text= item.text

section.section.section--soft
  .container
    .split
      .split__text
        p.eyebrow Sinatra core
        h2.section__title Or bring just the parts you need
        p
          | Already have a Sinatra app? We built every Padrino component to
            work on its own, so you can add the helpers, mailer or caching to
            it without changing anything else.
        = link_to '/guides/advanced-usage/standalone-usage-in-sinatra/', class: 'arrow-link' do
          | Standalone usage
          = icon(:arrow_right)
      .split__aside
        = partial '/_partials/code_window', locals: { window: data.home.sinatra_code }

section.section.cta
  .container
    h2.cta__title Start building with Padrino
    p.section__lead Follow the guides from your first project to a full application.
    .hero__actions
      = link_to '/guides/getting-started/basic-projects/', class: 'button--large' do
        | Read the guides
        = icon(:arrow_right)
      = link_to '/blog/', class: 'button--large button--secondary' do
        | Latest news
